## Local Development

### 1. Bootstrap the repository

Run:

```bash
./scripts/bootstrap.sh
```

This installs local dependencies and prepares the feature for development.

Expected responsibilities:

```text
install backend dependencies
install frontend dependencies
prepare local environment files
make scripts executable
```

---

### 2. Start the feature locally

Run:

```bash
./scripts/run-local.sh
```

Expected responsibilities:

```text
start backend
start frontend
render manifest
validate manifest
publish local release to registry
activate local release
```

The Shell should then discover the feature through the Bootstrap API.

