## Runtime Registration

The feature is described through:

```text
contracts/feature-manifest.json
```

The manifest declares:

```text
feature identity
frontend entrypoint
backend API base URL
navigation metadata
authorization requirements
feature flags
```

The platform runtime flow is:

```text
Feature run-local.sh
  → render manifest
  → publish to Registry
  → activate release
  → Bootstrap API reads active registry features
  → Bootstrap filters features by permissions and flags
  → Shell renders accessible features dynamically
```

