## Registry Integration

When registry mode is enabled, this feature publishes its manifest to the Registry Service.

Local flow:

```text
scripts/run-local.sh
  → render manifest
  → validate manifest
  → publish release
  → activate release
```

The Registry returns only active features to Bootstrap.

Bootstrap then filters features based on:

```text
requiredPermissions
requiredFlags
```

---

## Feature Flags

Feature flags are declared in the manifest authorization block:

```json
{
  "authorization": {
    "requiredPermissions": ["[[ names.feature_key ]].view"],
    "requiredFlags": ["[[ names.feature_key ]].enabled"]
  }
}
```

Bootstrap resolves flags and only returns the feature when all required flags are enabled.

