## Development Rules

### Do

```text
Use permission-shaped Entra app roles
Use require_permissions() on backend endpoints
Keep frontend authorization as UX-only
Declare required permissions in the feature manifest
Keep feature repos independent
Use scripts/bootstrap.sh and scripts/run-local.sh
```

### Do Not

```text
Do not hardcode features in the Shell
Do not add role-permission mappings in features
Do not convert scopes into business permissions
Do not trust frontend-only permission checks
Do not bypass Registry activation in production-like flows
```

