## Troubleshooting

### Feature does not appear in Shell

Check:

```text
Registry has active release
Bootstrap can reach Registry
User has required permission
Required feature flag is enabled
Manifest route and entry URL are correct
```

### Backend returns 403

Check:

```text
AUTH_DEFAULT_DEV_ROLES_RAW
X-Debug-Roles
AUTH_REQUIRED_PERMISSIONS_RAW
requiredPermissions in manifest
platform.admin if testing admin access
```

### Token validates but permissions are empty

Check that the token has a `roles` claim.

Expected:

```json
{
  "roles": ["[[ names.feature_key ]].view"]
}
```

Do not rely on `scp` for feature permissions.

### Production rejects debug headers

This is expected.

When:

```env
AUTH_MODE=entra
```

debug identity headers are rejected.

